cripts\\\\activate`\\n   ```\\n\\n3. **Install Dependencies**: Use pip to install the required packages. You can execute the following command:\\n   ```bash\\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\\n   ```\\n\\n## How to Use Chakin\\nOnce you have set up your environment, you can start using `chakin` to download word vectors.\\n\\n1. **Run Chakin**: You can run the `chakin` command followed by the desired options. For example:\\n   ```bash\\n   python chakin.py download --model word2vec --language english\\n   ```\\n\\n2. **Accessing Downloaded Vectors**: After downloading, the word vectors will be stored in the specified directory. You can use them in your NLP applications as needed.\\n\\n3. **Explore Options**: For more options and commands, you can use:\\n   ```bash\\n   python chakin.py --help\\n   ```\\n\\n## Conclusion\\n`chakin` is a powerful tool to access pre-trained word vectors, enabling users to enhance their NLP projects easily. By following the above instructions, you can quickly set up and start utilizing the capabilities of `chakin` in your applications.\\n","encoding":"utf-8","mode":"overwrite"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '{\n  "path": "docs/manual.md",\n  "absolute_path": "C:\\\\Users\\\\lucag\\\\SwarmDev_Parallel\\\\ChatDev\\\\WareHouse\\\\chakin_20260531153653\\\\code_workspace\\\\docs\\\\manual.md",\n  "size": 2236\n}', 'tool_call_id': 'call_BTRCsPs6q4vQllfMcUBu3v1t', 'metadata': {'tool_name': 'save_file', 'source': 'Chief Product Officer'}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'The user manual has been successfully created and saved as `manual.md` in the `docs` directory. Here’s a brief overview of its contents:\n\n### Chakin User Manual\n- **Introduction**: Overview of the `chakin` tool and its purpose in NLP applications.\n- **Main Functions**: Description of the core functionalities, including downloading word vectors and support for multiple formats.\n- **Installation and Environment Setup**: Step-by-step guide on